---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components'
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import donate from '../assets/donate.png';
---

<section id="sostienici" class="bg-[#F5F9FA]">
  <div class="mx-6 lg:mx-8">
    <div class="hidden lg:grid grid-cols-[2fr_3fr] gap-10 py-12">
      <div class="image-wrap reveal" style="--wipe-color: #F5F9FA">
        <Image src={donate} alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover"/>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-24">
        <h1 class="font-heading text-h1 reveal">Fai la differenza</h1>
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-4 reveal delay-300 float">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
          <Icon name="hand" class="size-24 shrink-0"/>
          <p class="font-heading text-h3 self-center">Dona il 5x1000</p>
          <p class="font-body text-h4">C.F. 91080740938</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
          <Icon name="bank" class="size-24 shrink-0"/>
          <p class="font-heading text-h3 self-center">Fai un‘ erogazione liberale</p>
          <p class="font-body text-h4">IBAN IT07 I030 6909 6061 0000 0151 820</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
          <Icon name="person" class="size-24 shrink-0"/>
          <p class="font-heading text-h3 self-center">Diventa socio</p>
          <p class="font-body text-h4">Con quota annuale</p>
        </div>
        </div>
        <p class="font-body text-h4 reveal delay-700">
          Con un semplice gesto contribuirai a sostenere i nostri progetti educativi e sociali che da anni attiviamo nel nostro territorio. Grazie!
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex lg:hidden flex-col items-center gap-6 py-10 text-center">
      <h1 class="font-heading text-h1 reveal">Fai la differenza</h1>

        <div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 reveal delay-150 float">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <Icon name="hand" class="size-12 shrink-0 gap-1"/>
          <p class="font-heading text-h2 self-center">Dona il 5x1000</p>
          <p class="font-body text-h4">C.F. 91080740938</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1">
          <Icon name="bank" class="size-12 shrink-0"/>
          <p class="font-heading text-h2 self-center">Fai un‘ erogazione liberale</p>
          <p class="font-body text-h4">IBAN IT07 I030 6909 6061 0000 0151 820</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1">
          <Icon name="person" class="size-12 shrink-0"/>
          <p class="font-heading text-h2 self-center">Diventa socio</p>
          <p class="font-body text-h4">Con quota annuale</p>
        </div>
        </div>
      <p class="font-body text-h4 reveal delay-700">
        Con un semplice gesto contribuirai a sostenere i nostri progetti educativi e sociali che da anni attiviamo nel nostro territorio. Grazie!
      </p>
      <div class="image-wrap reveal delay-150 w-full" style="--wipe-color: #F5F9FA">
        <Image src={donate} alt="" class="w-full object-cover"/>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
